<title>CANADA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT CANADIAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT CANADIAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>OAKVILLE, Ontario 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores in the</p>
<p>first round of the $1.5 million Canadian Open on Thursday</p>
